  "policy": {
    "goal": "Fill the world with ancient layered habitation and tactical props using primitive combinations first.",
    "rules": [
      "Prefer combinations of boxes, cylinders, rails, chains, and cloth planes before unique generated meshes.",
      "Every prop cluster must reinforce former use, current occupation, or tactical play.",
      "Decorative pieces must not block the reserved route envelope unless they are deliberate chokepoint structure.",
      "Generated texture work should extend the project-owned vector material family, not drift into painted biome swaps."
    ]
  },
